ncies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write docs/off-clock-link-chips.md with the which-links, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution, look, placement, tooltip, liveness, toggle, and vector [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tables below, register it, and add two cross-links.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The chip in bob-ledger-tools (bob-plugins)[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chip[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chip: implement the contract in bob-ledger-tools — pure core, Live [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Preview widget, Reading-view sweep, shared CSS, toggle, liveness, unit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and parity tests, plugin docs, build, and bob plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian e2e and visual review (bob-plugins, bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live_verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chip[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live_verify: drive the chip in an isolated real-Obsidian scratch vault, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compare its computed look with the Event Task chip, record screenshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and timings, and write the contract's Live verification section.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-gf","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-gf.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-dcbb15bcfe2b63e5ce1ebd0e7b3e78b7","started_at":"2026-11-03T14:54:12.833006+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"910a9420b2fe2c5fe7cf83bf96f9dd15184c70404e8258c2a1cbb9331e400cf3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-gf.2--1